  characterName: WilliamTull
  promptText: "Weekend visitors are choking our hills and springs with single-use
    plastic. A waste firm offers a \u201Crecovery depot\u201D beside our green space:
    jobs and a clinic van some days, but constant plastic handling and a risk to
    our springs. Do I accept it?"
  leftAnswer: Yes, accept the depot for the jobs and services now.
  rightAnswer: No, refuse; the springs and the medicines must stay clean.
